MASTER PROMPT: NICE NIGHT BURGER

Complete Responsive Restaurant Ordering Website

Act as a senior full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, software architect, and restaurant digital product specialist.

Build a polished, modern, fully responsive restaurant website for a fictional burger brand called Nice Night Burger.

This must be a functional web application, not just a landing page, static mockup, or collection of non-functional buttons.

The website must include a customer-facing storefront, digital menu, shopping cart, checkout flow, order tracking, customer account features, and an administrative dashboard for restaurant management.

Prioritize a visually impressive design, practical functionality, maintainable code, and a smooth user experience on mobile phones, tablets, and desktop computers.

Do not stop after creating the homepage. Implement all core pages, navigation, application states, sample data, and functional interactions.

